g is green then it needs the lion.**.\n   - This tells us that if the dog is green, it needs the lion.But we don't know if the dog is green.\n\n6.**If something visits the dog then it is green.**.\n   - This tells us that if the dog visits the dog, it is green.But we don't know if the dog visits the dog.\n\n7.**If something needs the lion then it chases the lion.**.\n   - This tells us that if the dog needs the lion, it chases the lion.The dog is definitely rough and we can conclude that with certainty based on the information given.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
