.\n     - If Fiona is cold, then she is nice (from the context).\n     - All nice things are white (from the context).\n     - Therefore, if Fiona is cold, she is white.\n\n   - **Rough Status:**.\n     - White, smart things are rough (from the context).\n     - Since Fiona is white and smart, she must be rough.\n\n   - **Fiona\'s Cold Status:**.\n     - We need to check if Fiona is cold to determine her roughness.Based on the context provided, the statement "Fiona is rough" is known.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
