hey eat the bald eagle.\n   - If someone is green and rough then they chase the lion.\n   - If someone eats the lion then they do not eat the cat.\n   - If someone likes the cat and the cat is not green then the cat is blue.\n\n2.**Lion and Cat Relationship**:.\n   - The lion chases the dog.\n   - The lion is not red.\n   - The cat eats the lion.\nThe lion likes the cat, based on the given information.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
