n it is not nice.\n     - Therefore, Charlie is not nice.\n\n6.**Conclusion:**.\n   - Based on the logical relationships and the given information, Charlie is not nice.\n\nThus, the statement "Charlie is nice" is false.\n</think>.\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
