Gary is smart, he must be green (from "Smart people are green").\n   - Since Gary is furry and smart, he must be big (from "If someone is smart and furry then they are big").\n   - Gary is not white (from the statement "If Gary is not smart and Gary is furry then Gary is white").\n   - Since Gary is not white, he must be furry (from the statement "If Bob is not green and Bob is not white then Bob is furry").\n   - Gary is not blue (since he is not white and not cold, and all cold people are not blue).Based on the information provided, Gary is warm.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
