hite, big things are round, Erin is round.\n   - Since Erin is round, and round, rough things are smart, Erin must be smart.\n   - Since Erin is white, and white, furry things are round, Erin must be furry.\n   - Since Erin is furry, and if something is furry, it is rough, Erin must be rough.\n   - Since Erin is rough, and rough, smart things are smart, Erin must be smart.\n   - Since Erin is smart, and if Dave is smart, then Dave is white, and Dave is furry, rough, and smart, we can confirm that Dave is white.\n   - Since Erin is white, and all white, big things are round, and Erin is big, Erin must be round.Erin is quiet. Therefore, the statement "Erin is not quiet" is false.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
