nne is big then Anne is not furry.\n     - Anne is green, so Anne cannot be green.\n     - Therefore, Anne cannot be white based on this statement.\n   - **Statement 2:** Furry people are kind.\n   - **Statement 3:** If someone is kind then they are white.\n   - **Statement 4:** If someone is white then they are big.Dave can be white based on the statements provided. The information does not definitively prove that Dave is not white.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
