w, this resolves the contradiction. Therefore, the statement "The bear does not eat the lion" must be false.\n\nThus, the correct answer is:.\n</think>.\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 85%|########5 | 512/600 [21:23<01:57,  1.33s/it]
